                                "sense_id": "e3f9ba66-20f6-3438-8595-a623a25f0dbe",
                                "text": "“He writes incredible opinions and becomes an advocate for his position. He is a very scholarly man.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6da951ad-35ce-4db2-bca2-0d8e6f9bbe15",
                                "sense_id": "e3f9ba66-20f6-3438-8595-a623a25f0dbe",
                                "text": "Here undoubtedly the foundations were laid for the notable research work and the scholarly outlook for which his name is remembered."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "45f7da84-7bb7-4a82-9a23-2150ded7222e",
                                "sense_id": "e3f9ba66-20f6-3438-8595-a623a25f0dbe",
                                "text": "For those of you that are so scholarly and you've been around the Church for so long, you're like, “Clearly, that is a reference to the triune Godhead.”"
                            }
                        ]
